# Frontend Component Guidelines

## Component Structure
- Use functional components with hooks
- Follow React 19 best practices
- Use TailwindCSS for styling
- Implement dark mode support

## Key Components
- [src/components/Timetable.jsx](mdc:src/components/Timetable.jsx) - Main timetable display
- [src/components/admin/AdminTimetable.jsx](mdc:src/components/admin/AdminTimetable.jsx) - Admin timetable management
- [src/components/CityTips.jsx](mdc:src/components/CityTips.jsx) - City recommendations
- [src/components/Admin.jsx](mdc:src/components/Admin.jsx) - Admin dashboard

## Timetable Categories
Use these category types with proper styling:
- `team-round` - 👥 Team-Runde (red theme)
- `individual-round` - 👤 Einzel-Runde (blue theme)
- `workshop` - 🎓 Workshop (green theme)
- `fun` - 🎉 Fun (yellow theme)
- `aftershow` - 🎭 Aftershow (purple theme)

## Styling Guidelines
- Use consistent color schemes for categories
- Implement hover effects and transitions
- Ensure responsive design
- Support both light and dark themes
